    "text": "The function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></math>, has",
