  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/0480c4ba-a295-4d9e-9f37-e9cfad158b09.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 99px;\"/></p><p>The function changes from positive to negative at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and from negative to positive at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So, the point of local maxima <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mfenced></math> is at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and the point of local minima <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfenced></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
